{"text": "Ouachita Parish Sheriff\u2019s Office\nP.O. Box 1803\nMonroe, LA 71210-1803\nTelephone (318) 329-1200\n\nFebruary 24, 2020\n\nMuckRock News\nDEPT MR 87873\n411A Highland Ave.\nSomerville, MA 02144-2516\nAttn: Joanna Hernandez\n\nWe received your public records request regarding documents relating to the Automated License Plate\nReader system.\n\nWe have referred your request to our legal counsel listed below for review and a response. | have also\ncopied him on this response.\n\nMr. Craig Frosch, Attorney\nUrsury, Weeks and Matthews\n504-592-4600\n\nThe Ouachita Parish Sheriff's Office charges a fee of $1.75 per page for requested public record\ndocuments. Once Mr. Frosch has reviewed the documents and prepared a response to you, | will advise\nyou of the fee amount. Once the payment is received, the information will be forwarded to you.\n\nSincerely,\n\nGlenn Springfield\nPublic Information Officer\nOuachita Parish Sheriff's Office",
